--------------------------------------------------
PHASE 5.2 VERIFIED FIXES
--------------------------------------------------

Preserve both fixes discovered during Phase 5.2.

1. PRINTFUL EXTERNAL ID

Printful external_id has a 32-character limit.

Current implementation:

so-<29 UUID characters with dashes removed>

Example:

so-35f1853d68d7448191c2ca36e81bb

DO NOT revert to:

store-order-<full UUID>

2. CHECKOUT/ORDER RECOVERY

If Stripe Checkout Session creation succeeds but local order insertion
fails, checkout.session.completed can reconstruct a paid local order from
Stripe session metadata.

Recovered orders use:

status = paid
fulfillment_status = needs_admin_review

Do NOT silently lose paid orders.

Do NOT reconstruct an immutable manufacturing snapshot from current
product state if the original snapshot does not exist.

